cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper it accompanies."
title: "BOARDS-AI: Mock Simulator"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the BOARDS-AI radiology OSCE simulator: an
  LLM-driven pipeline that generates OSCE-style multiple-choice questions from
  radiology case data, evaluates candidate responses with structured feedback,
  and collects expert ratings through a benchmarking portal.
type: software
